      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. it seems like the movement was pretty much always righteous in its goals though. like, even when businesses tried to fight back, they were basically just trying to stop progress, right? it's hard to see how any of the opposition could be considered legitimate if they were just working against the interests of the people.",
